From: GS Verde Law <litigation@gsverdelaw.example> (solicitors for Procoll)
To: Trinsic Collagen Ltd <m.newby@trinsic-collagen.example>
Date: 2024-06-01
Subject: Letter of claim: sums due from Trinsic Collagen Ltd to Procoll Ltd

We act for Procoll Ltd. Our client claims payment of the debts due to it from Trinsic Collagen Ltd under the Supply Agreement dated 7 November 2022, namely:

1. the amount unpaid on the invoice for the October Order (£15,000.00);
2. the amount unpaid on the invoice for the November Order (£30,000.00); and
3. the cost of the Minimum Purchase Amounts from December 2023 onwards, at 5000 g per month.

Under clause 14.5 all amounts due must be paid in full without any set-off, counterclaim, deduction or withholding.

